# ── Audio & images are ignored by default ──────────────────────────────
# Raw recordings and generated plots are large and numerous; they stay local.
*.wav
*.png

# ── EXCEPTION: curated evidence is committed ───────────────────────────
# docs/evidence/ holds a small, hand-picked set of artifacts that back our
# SIH claims (hardware limits, spectral comparisons). Keep it lean:
#   • WAV: mono, 16-bit, <= 2 s  (~188 KB each)
#   • PNG: dpi=110, <= 400 KB each
#   • Target total: under ~15 MB for the whole folder
# Anything not needed to defend a claim in a report/PPT does NOT belong here.
!docs/evidence/
!docs/evidence/**/
!docs/evidence/**/*.wav
!docs/evidence/**/*.png

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.env
.pytest_cache/
.pytest_cache/
